<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Tokyo Q1 net up 260 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Tokyo Q1 net up 260 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	  43.56    vs	12.08</p>
<p>    Turnover	   414.68    vs     257.19</p>
<p>    Tax provision     10.33    vs	 5.36</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. Tokyo Cement manufactures cement using imported raw material. Japan's Mitsui Mining Co has a 27.5 percent stake in Tokyo Cement.</p>
<p>--- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
